<p class=3D"title">Prefix List - 2025</p>
<p>This list includes the most common prefixes (a word element that only us=
ed as a prefix) and combining forms.  Please note that prefixes can be used=
 by itself (prefix), with space (prefix ), or with hyphen (prefix-). For ex=
ample, prefix of "non" can be added to word significant as:
</p><ul>
<li>nonsignificant|significant
</li><li>non-significant|significant
</li><li>non significant|significant
</li></ul>
